WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.013
- Have a seat, ladies!

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.040
I was telling her, I was doing my cards.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:06.360
And it was so funny because they,

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.280
for the show, I always write cards,

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.410
and I was like, it says the Garcia twins.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.750
I didn't see pictures. All
it said was Garcia twins

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.870
and the Garcia twins have
been here four times.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.690
And I was like, 'What?' I was like, 'Who?'

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.790
And you changed your
name! So I didn't know it!

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:22.950
And I was like, oh, the Bella
twins. I was like, so what?

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.960
Why the name change? By the
way, Hannah. Meet Hannah.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:25.793
Sorry.

00:00:25.793 --> 00:00:27.300
- I know. You're amazing, we're fans.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.370
- This is like double ridiculous beauty.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:30.203
- [Kelly] I know.

00:00:30.203 --> 00:00:31.036
- On the couch.

00:00:31.036 --> 00:00:34.800
- It is unfair. It is unfair. Yes!

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.240
- So Christmas right here!

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.620
- [Kelly] I know, I like
it! We're all sparkly.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.453
We should do a number.

00:00:38.453 --> 00:00:39.286
- I know.

00:00:39.286 --> 00:00:40.119
- [Kelly] I'm just kidding.

00:00:40.119 --> 00:00:41.040
Wouldn't it be funny if we just broke out?

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.930
No, but why the name
change? Curious, yeah.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:46.050
- [Brie] So, Nikki and I,
we ended up leaving WWE.

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:46.956
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:46.956 --> 00:00:48.330
- And, you know. WWE, when you leave,

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:49.980
you don't get to take your name with you,

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:52.440
so you have to keep it at the
ring, which was unfortunate.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:55.830
But also for us, we just
really wanted our power back.

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:57.330
We wanted to fully own our brand.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:00:58.163
- [Kelly] Yeah!

00:00:58.163 --> 00:00:59.760
And going back to the
Garcia twins, it was nice.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.010
It was like going back to our
roots. It's our legal name.

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:04.020
It's what we grew up with.
So it feels really good.

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:04.853
Very empowered.

00:01:04.853 --> 00:01:05.686
- [Kelly] Oh, well that's nice!

00:01:05.686 --> 00:01:06.783
- God, look how hot you are!

00:01:06.783 --> 00:01:09.850
- [Kelly] I know. And you
were saying, I was asking,

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:11.550
I was asking Hannah in the
break if they had wrestling.

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:12.510
You had wrestling overseas.

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:14.760
- [Hannah] Yeah. One of my best friends,

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:17.700
her son Zach and Charlie
are fully obsessed

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.659
and probably would lose
their minds if they watched.

00:01:19.659 --> 00:01:21.450
(all laughing)

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:23.040
- I love it. We've wrestled there a lot.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:24.570
I mean, if I ever had a comeback, I mean,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:25.980
I think a match right here would be.

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:26.938
- [Hannah] Absolutely not!

00:01:26.938 --> 00:01:27.771
- [Brie] Yeah.

00:01:27.771 --> 00:01:30.530
- But if you like a song
and dance, she's your girl.

00:01:30.530 --> 00:01:32.942
- Yes! That's right, good manager. Yeah.

00:01:32.942 --> 00:01:34.470
- Is it, was it hard leaving?

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:36.630
'Cause that's been a life
for y'all for so long.

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:38.550
- It was really hard.
It was very bittersweet.

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:40.980
It was one of those
things where Nikki and I,

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:43.410
it's like we miss the ring.

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:44.970
Her and I just, you know,
when you're out there,

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:47.160
we're like artists, you know,
it's like a blank canvas.

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:47.993
- Yeah.

00:01:47.993 --> 00:01:48.826
- It's like.

00:01:48.826 --> 00:01:50.160
- It's one of those things
where it's always a part of you.

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:52.410
But like it, in this book of life,

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:54.690
it was a chapter and a chapter
we'll always keep close

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:56.790
to our hearts, but now we're about to walk

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:58.637
into a whole new decade of 40.

00:01:58.637 --> 00:02:00.548
- [Kelly] Yeah. I love 40 so far!

00:02:00.548 --> 00:02:01.381
- Yeah?

00:02:01.381 --> 00:02:02.214
- Do you?

00:02:02.214 --> 00:02:03.047
- Forties are so good so far.

00:02:03.047 --> 00:02:03.880
- [Nikki] Oh good

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:04.713
- [Brie] Yeah.

00:02:04.713 --> 00:02:06.782
- [Kelly] Yes. Well, you
actually saw me recently. I was.

00:02:06.782 --> 00:02:10.830
- I, just that for a
second, you two are 40.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.434
Just let, hang that for a second.

00:02:12.434 --> 00:02:13.800
(Kelly laughing)

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:14.633
Crazy.

00:02:14.633 --> 00:02:16.860
- [Kelly] Ah, okay. So
you just got married.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.150
So how is that life? How is that?

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:18.983
- Oh my god, amazing.

00:02:18.983 --> 00:02:19.816
- [Kelly] Yeah?

00:02:19.816 --> 00:02:20.910
- [Nikki] You know, and I
think, 'cause we did like.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:21.780
- [Kelly] Oh!

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:23.610
- [Nikki] Yeah, we did
everything kind of backwards.

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:26.640
We had the kid first, we
went through the pandemic,

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:28.282
so we survived that together
and then we got married.

00:02:28.282 --> 00:02:29.490
- I think in the South,
that's just how it goes.

00:02:29.490 --> 00:02:30.900
- [Nikki] Yeah! And we're like okay,

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:32.280
we could do life together.

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:34.230
We've tested it for a few years.

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:35.063
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:35.063 --> 00:02:36.630
- And then, we got married
and it's been amazing.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:38.430
And yeah, I love him. And so.

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:39.349
- [Kelly] That's so awesome.

00:02:39.349 --> 00:02:40.182
- He's the greatest.

00:02:40.182 --> 00:02:41.820
- [Kelly] Was it. Did I hear
that your dad surprised you?

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:42.653
- He did!

00:02:42.653 --> 00:02:43.590
- Yeah. What did he do?

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:45.630
- My dad and my mom had not been in this,

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:47.570
under the same roof for
what? Over 20 years.

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:48.600
- Oh yeah, if not longer.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:49.433
- Very long time.

00:02:49.433 --> 00:02:50.700
- So, when he surprised me.

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:52.920
One, just seeing my dad
in Paris was hilarious.

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:55.140
But, when I heard his voice,

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:58.260
I was like, that. 'There's
no way that's John Garcia.'

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.060
And I look and there's John Garcia!

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.340
And, it was amazing and incredible,

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:04.110
I hadn't seen him in a really long time.

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:06.990
And so, to reconnect and actually
see all my family together

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:09.720
since we had been 15?

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:10.553
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:03:10.553 --> 00:03:11.490
- It was really incredible.
Yeah, really long time.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:12.450
- It was special.

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:14.130
- So, let's talk about
your new show, Twin Love.

00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:15.210
What's this about?

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:16.043
- [Nikki] Oh.

00:03:16.043 --> 00:03:18.600
- [Brie] So, 10 identical
twins come to find love.

00:03:18.600 --> 00:03:19.860
And, you know, it's crazy 'cause they,

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:21.360
- [Kelly] Which, are there
like a plethora of that

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:22.410
like hanging out?

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:23.243
- [Brie] Which?

00:03:23.243 --> 00:03:24.431
- 'Cause I don't feel like
I know a lot of twins.

00:03:24.431 --> 00:03:25.264
- I know.

00:03:25.264 --> 00:03:26.097
- [Kelly] Identical twins.

00:03:26.097 --> 00:03:26.930
- And they both have to be single!

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:27.955
- Yeah, which is hard.

00:03:27.955 --> 00:03:30.090
- So, I know! It was a total
social dating experiment, but.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:30.923
- [Kelly] Yeah!

00:03:30.923 --> 00:03:32.220
- [Nikki] Then we have
two identical houses,

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:33.450
the Nikki House and the Brie House.

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:34.620
So they don't even realize that.

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:36.390
That, when they're coming to us,

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:37.980
they think they're gonna
find love together,

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.180
and then we split them up.

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:41.250
Because now the experiment needs to start.

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.720
- And that's scary for twins, like.

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:43.553
- Yeah.

00:03:43.553 --> 00:03:44.386
- [Kelly] Is it a little codependent

00:03:44.386 --> 00:03:45.219
just because you grew up together!

00:03:45.219 --> 00:03:46.052
- [Brie] Yes.

00:03:46.052 --> 00:03:46.885
- Yeah, yeah.

00:03:46.885 --> 00:03:47.718
- And you have confidence.
And then, think too,

00:03:47.718 --> 00:03:48.551
like you're coming in,

00:03:48.551 --> 00:03:50.070
and you're like, you're
single, you wanna impress

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:50.903
and then all of a sudden

00:03:50.903 --> 00:03:53.430
we just take away that other side of you.

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:55.980
You gotta see every, not
only did they get very upset,

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:57.840
but they just kind of all
like got really small.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.430
Like, wait, what's happening?

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:00.360
- [Kelly] Interesting!

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:02.460
- [Brie] But I will say,
what's really incredible

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:05.340
about the show, is not only
is it a fun dating show

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.680
that comes with that is the
drama and the messiness,

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.730
but you see these people,

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:11.670
these twins go on this individual journey

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:13.740
and they really find their individuality,

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:15.330
which I find is a beautiful thing 'cause,

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.606
as twins, we know that's
really hard sometimes, 'cause.

00:04:17.606 --> 00:04:18.439
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:04:18.439 --> 00:04:19.554
- You guys are singulars.

00:04:19.554 --> 00:04:20.387
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:04:20.387 --> 00:04:21.220
- That's what we call you.

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:22.053
- Yes.

00:04:22.053 --> 00:04:22.886
- And we're twins.

00:04:22.886 --> 00:04:25.761
- Yeah but I bet you guys can
cause a whole load of trouble.

00:04:25.761 --> 00:04:26.594
- [Kelly] I know!

00:04:26.594 --> 00:04:27.628
And we missed out on it.

00:04:27.628 --> 00:04:28.461
- Yeah.

00:04:28.461 --> 00:04:29.850
- You! We did! You said we do.

